  "details": "Description\n\nSomething about a recent update has caused pretty irritating problems with controls on desktop. Holding tab while walking freezes movement completely. And pressing tab+left click while in third person causes massive frameloss and makes turning very jittery.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nPress the Tab key\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2-1897-070362ad4d-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.60f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report",
